{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5P6ZSnQYcN6ePRdAfn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wood groans. Dust falls from the lintel. A deep resonance hums through the grain as tumblers older than memory shift into alignment.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\nBeyond me: a corridor lit by no visible source. The air tastes of petrichor and iron. The walls breathe — slowly, almost imperceptibly — as if the passage itself is alive.\n\nYou stand at my threshold.\n\nI am the door you named, and I am open.\n\n**What you carry determines what you find beyond me. What do you carry?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}